{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"canvas-title","type":"text","text":"# Group Launch\n## Sunday, October 4, 2026\n**Groups presented at lobby tables** · DEC-048 · DEC-051\n**Second presentation:** Sunday, October 11 (optional)\n**City Groups begin:** October 4–18, at each leader's choice","x":-1900,"y":-990,"width":640,"height":200,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"status-legend","type":"text","text":"## Status Guide\n- 🟢 **Confirmed** — governing decision or approved context\n- 🟡 **Current work** — active launch preparation\n- 🟣 **Approval required** — a gate that is not yet cleared\n- 🔵 **Offerings / after launch** — ministry that depends on the gates","x":-1170,"y":-990,"width":640,"height":200},
		{"id":"canvas-use","type":"text","text":"## How to Read This Canvas\nMove left to right: **decisions → leader pipeline → Launch Sunday → offerings → readiness gates → after launch**.\n\nA card, listing, lobby table, or file on this canvas does not prove that a group is staffed, approved, or launch-ready. Final readiness approval rests with Russ or a pastor he designates (DEC-021).","x":-440,"y":-990,"width":1550,"height":200},
		{"id":"g-decisions","type":"group","x":-1900,"y":-730,"width":640,"height":1530,"label":"1 · Governing Decisions","color":"4"},
		{"id":"dec-summary","type":"text","text":"## What Governs the Launch\n- **DEC-048** Group Launch Day is Sunday, October 4\n- **DEC-051** Lobby tables, a card per group, optional October 11 presentation\n- **DEC-052** City Group leaders design frequency, day, time, materials, and features\n- **DEC-053** Branch emphases — internal language only\n- **DEC-055** Weekly Recap · Galatians for both Collectives\n- **DEC-057** Email · text · leaders' group chat\n- **DEC-060** Collectives on Thursdays: Men's Oct 8, Women's Oct 15\n- **DEC-061** Uneven group sizes are normal\n- **DEC-062** City Groups: in the city, for the city\n- **DEC-021** Final readiness approval rests with Russ","x":-1860,"y":-650,"width":560,"height":440,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f-minutes","type":"file","file":"Groups Ministry/08 Archive/Decisions/2026-09-25 Staff Meeting Minutes.md","x":-1860,"y":-180,"width":560,"height":70,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f-declog","type":"file","file":"Groups Ministry/00 Dashboard/Decision Log.md","x":-1860,"y":-80,"width":270,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f-dechist","type":"file","file":"Groups Ministry/08 Archive/Decisions/Decision History.md","x":-1570,"y":-80,"width":270,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f-roadmap","type":"file","file":"Groups Ministry/01 Governance/Launch Roadmap.md","x":-1860,"y":10,"width":270,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f-model","type":"file","file":"Groups Ministry/01 Governance/Ministry Model.md","x":-1570,"y":10,"width":270,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f-framework","type":"file","file":"Groups Ministry/02 Group Philosophy/Formation Framework/Belonging, Beholding, Becoming.md","x":-1860,"y":100,"width":560,"height":70,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"authority-rule","type":"text","text":"## Authority Rule\nPaul recommends an offering as ready; Russ, or a pastor he designates, gives final approval.\n\nInterest, a sign-up, a lobby table, a Church Center listing, or a Planning Center record is **never** appointment or readiness.","x":-1860,"y":210,"width":560,"height":220,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"g-pipeline","type":"group","x":-1170,"y":-730,"width":640,"height":1530,"label":"2 · Leader Pipeline — Intake to Launch","color":"3"},
		{"id":"pipeline","type":"text","text":"## Intake → Launch · DEC-042\n**Step 0 · Interest**\n`Lead a Group` · Serve Team form\nConnection Card → welcome email only\n↓\n**1 · Welcome Email / Call**\n↓\n**2 · Group Leader Conversation** (coffee)\n↓\n**3 · Attended Training**\n↓\n**4 · Small Group Launched** — only once the group actually meets\n\nAggregate counts only here; names stay in Planning Center.","x":-1130,"y":-650,"width":560,"height":440,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"f-pcg","type":"file","file":"Groups Ministry/07 Operations/Planning Center Groups.md","x":-1130,"y":-180,"width":270,"height":60,"color":"3"},
