		{"id":"pipeline-open","type":"text","text":"## Ready to Lead · DEC-059\nGroup Leader Conversation (spiritual maturity, season of life) + brief training → **Paul and Russ decide together**.\n\nStill open: training record, appointment record, commissioning · **BWR-006**","x":-1130,"y":270,"width":560,"height":180,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"g-sunday","type":"group","x":-440,"y":-730,"width":700,"height":1530,"label":"3 · Launch Sunday — October 4","color":"3"},
		{"id":"lobby","type":"text","text":"## Lobby Tables\nGroup leaders introduce their groups to people interested in joining.\n\nGroups that still have many open spots may present again on **Sunday, October 11**.\n\n**Owner:** Paul · BWR-028","x":-400,"y":-650,"width":620,"height":200,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"card","type":"text","text":"## Information Card — one per group\n- Meeting time\n- **Rough location only**, e.g. \"North Thornton\"\n- Join QR code → a **tested** destination (BWR-009)\n\nNo addresses on cards, the website, or Church Center. Full details are emailed to people who join.","x":-400,"y":-420,"width":620,"height":230,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"finalize","type":"text","text":"## Before October 4\nPaul finalizes each group's details with its leaders by email and text, then updates the Groups webpage: leader photos, final times, and rough locations (DEC-051).","x":-400,"y":-160,"width":620,"height":150,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"f-launch-overview","type":"file","file":"Groups Ministry/07 Operations/Group Launches/Group Launch Overview.md","x":-400,"y":20,"width":300,"height":60,"color":"3"},
