		{"id":"first-gatherings","type":"text","text":"## First Gatherings\nCity Groups begin between **October 4 and 18**, at each leader's choice. The first several gatherings focus mainly on getting to know the people who have joined (DEC-052).","x":-400,"y":290,"width":620,"height":160,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"g-offerings","type":"group","x":350,"y":-730,"width":780,"height":1530,"label":"4 · Offerings by Branch","color":"5"},
		{"id":"city","type":"text","text":"## City Groups — life together\n**Blocked** · no appointed hosts, locations, or approvals recorded\n\nLeaders choose weekly or biweekly, day, time, materials, and features (young adults, young couples, single moms). Features describe; they don't restrict.\n\nRun Club and a possible Youth City Group sit here but remain deferred (DEC-022).","x":390,"y":-650,"width":340,"height":380,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f-city","type":"file","file":"Groups Ministry/03 Groups/City Groups/City Groups Overview.md","x":390,"y":-240,"width":340,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f-recap","type":"file","file":"Groups Ministry/06 Resources/Group Life/Weekly Recaps.md","x":390,"y":-150,"width":340,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f-policies","type":"file","file":"Groups Ministry/06 Resources/Leader Development/Policies.md","x":390,"y":-60,"width":340,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"collectives","type":"text","text":"## Collectives — shared encouragement\n**At Risk**\n\n**Men's** · Thursdays from **October 8** · the Dalys' home for now · Conner + Russ intended\n\n**Women's** · Thursdays from **October 15** · likely rotating between the Dalys' and O'Briens' · Rachel + Miranda intended\n\nGalatians through 2026 · devotional → breakout tables · future on-site intent (DEC-060)","x":750,"y":-650,"width":340,"height":380,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f-mens","type":"file","file":"Groups Ministry/03 Groups/Collectives/Men's Collective.md","x":750,"y":-240,"width":340,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f-womens","type":"file","file":"Groups Ministry/03 Groups/Collectives/Women's Collective.md","x":750,"y":-150,"width":340,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f-gathering","type":"file","file":"Groups Ministry/10 Templates/Gatherings/Collective Gathering.md","x":750,"y":-60,"width":340,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"bible","type":"text","text":"## Bible Clubs — rooted in Scripture\n**At Risk**\n\n*Planted.* · Tuesday evenings from **October 6** · twelve weeks · Paul leads · very likely at Barn Door Coffee, Broomfield (confirming) · recurs every fall","x":390,"y":40,"width":700,"height":180,"color":"5"},
