		{"id":"g-after","type":"group","x":2010,"y":-730,"width":640,"height":1530,"label":"6 · After Launch — Supporting Leaders","color":"5"},
		{"id":"collab","type":"text","text":"## First Group Leader Collaboration\n**Early November 2026** · a dinner for all current leaders, about one month after October 4\n\nHear how everyone's groups went · align with mission, vision, and values · CoJourner may run here (DEC-056)\n\n**Date and place open** · BWR-031","x":2050,"y":-650,"width":560,"height":240,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"channels","type":"text","text":"## Leader Communication · DEC-057\n**Email** — general information\n**Text** — internal coordination\n**Church Center group chat** — all current leaders\n\nHosts may run their own group chats. Sensitive care details stay out of every channel (DEC-028).","x":2050,"y":-380,"width":560,"height":220,"color":"5"},
