		{"id":"readiness-workflow-note","type":"text","text":"## Group Launch Readiness · DEC-059\nReady leader → City Group Profile form → Planning Center group + leaders assigned → Russ's quick review → Church Center, **Open Groups** webpage, and table card.\n\nSeparate from the Lead a Group workflow.","x":-400,"y":570,"width":620,"height":180,"color":"3"}
